{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act33side_level_act33side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act33side",
  "stageId": "act33side_06",
  "title": "燈火閃爍不定",
  "storyCode": "BB-6",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3bb72d76cb886823a007128c47504db7c11d58ad99c3f8bff100d4acff21e320",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_iceforest_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面！快看前面！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "橋樑……被炸毀了？我們要怎麼過去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們，我們還有別的路嗎？走了這麼久，天災雲還是在頭頂上……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隊伍裡還有傷患和孩子，我們，我們走不動了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snow_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該死！森林和草地上到處都是源石晶簇，它們……它們已經開始發亮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在天災爆發前，這些活性化的炸藥會先要了我們的命……\n咳。\n我們必須立刻——\n咳咳——\n咳咳咳——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不，不，不能再拖下去了。空氣裡都是源石顆粒，*薩卡茲粗口*。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "七八天沒有藥物補給了……隊伍裡的傷患……感染情況……該死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什、什麼聲音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_ex1_snowmount_s"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巴別塔的救援還沒到嗎？沒有？那就繼續讓斥候探路去，找不到別回來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，天災雲都成型了，是哪支*薩卡茲粗口*的部隊襲擊了醫療據點！“疤眼”都沒這麼瘋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後面的人跟緊點！來不及離開天災範圍，我們得找幾個乾淨的洞窟躲一躲！洞裡有源石痕跡的不行，有一點都不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……真該死！傷患都不放過，你真不是個東西特雷西斯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cave_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲小孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "媽媽……我痛……腳痛……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲平民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_935_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不哭，孩子，再忍一忍，忍一忍就能回家了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不要——不要——\n嗚啊啊啊痛——痛……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_thundercloud"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "孩子的哭聲。\n陰謀的聲音，死亡的聲音，求生的聲音。\n天災無情，只是吞吃風雪，醞釀風暴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_ex1_snowmount_s"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "遠方的山崖上，有幾道人影。\n風雪肅穆，站在懸崖邊的女性只是沉默地看著遠方。\n無情的天災，在要道鎮守的敵方士兵，逃竄的野獸，走投無路的傷患和平民。\n生命如空谷迴響，回到Mantra的耳中，那是——\n——孩子的哭聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我聽見了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子的哭聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1309_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "開始飄雪了，情況不太好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩千三百一十三人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "全部確認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1309_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……位置，生命徵象，已經全部錄入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1309_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "損失比想的要少，但還是得加快了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1309_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mantra小姐，近距離目睹你的源石技藝，還是讓人大開眼界。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（謙遜地點頭致意）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1309_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人事部的那位笞心魔還沒有為你物色到幾名出色的通訊兵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（輕閉雙眼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1309_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遺憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1309_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……訊息已發送至全部行動隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "東北方向，七公里，洞窟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子們在那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1309_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但軍事委員會的偵察無人機已經發現我們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1309_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我留下，你去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（皺眉）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1309_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們不敢選在這個地形和我的小隊正面衝突。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1309_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心吧。只是去打個招呼，如果是曼弗雷德領頭，我就爭取把他活捉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mantra",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要冒險——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "各位，是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "抱歉來晚了。CA建築區的行動已經結束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "請各位繼續依Mantra的原計劃行動，我將從別處提供幫助，以拯救傷患和平民為優先。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1309_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不錯的出場時機，博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "謝謝。Misery正在吸引軍事委員會的注意，他會需要其他幫手的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1309_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那正好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "正好，Ace。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1309_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等你命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "以及……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "特蕾西婭將直接突入中心的受災醫療據點，避免更大的傷亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "若各單位狀況良好……我們那裡見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snow_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爆炸！是爆炸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別慌！離開發光的地面！往後退！地下源石開始活性化了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*薩卡茲粗口*來不及——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "火光在凍土下蠢蠢欲動，暴雪夾雜著天災的火花。\n每一口呼吸都無比沉重，彷彿“泰拉”這個抽象的概念，正在壓迫一個個具體的生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "而這種壓迫，在轉瞬之間消失殆盡。\n但眼前的景象卻讓人下意識地長吸了一口氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嘶——\n爆炸怎麼……停止了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不僅如此……雪花……雪花竟然停在半空中？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1310_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "此刻的雪花冰晶已經近乎源石結晶，如果你足夠細心，可以控制住它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你，您……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1310_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "精確控制一片片雪花極為困難，但是在富源石環境，停滯一片暴雪，反而不該是難事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1310_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾丹，你沒有好好聽課。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老……老師！您來了！您……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1310_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能撐十分鐘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1310_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "退回谷底的草地上去，向南走，Scout會為你們指引一條路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1310_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及，我怎麼教你的？暴露在富源石環境中行軍，有很多應急防護手段。你卻什麼都沒做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1310_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等……你的隊伍裡甚至有急性礦石病患者，不像話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1310_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "注射劑，接著！再多給你十分鐘原地休整！我來想辦法！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1308_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老師，可是您——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1310_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在天災真正形成之前，動作快！趁我還能掐住它的脖子，至少這附近都是安全的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1310_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1310_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我現在同時使用著幾種法術，各來自什麼學派，這週末前我要看到你的論文。你們所有人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pith",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1310_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……所以活著回去，聽到沒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_iceforest_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……是我，曼弗雷德還沒有明確的命令？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他搞什麼？啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可能！王庭的重要成員？混在難民和巴別塔的軍隊裡？喂，查一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "查什麼，鬼扯。大概是曼弗雷德隨便找的藉口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算有，那也已經算巴別塔的俘虜了吧？從天災下解救俘虜，根本不是說好的任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我們還不是得照做，真是，喂，讓荊棘小隊去確認一下我們的關卡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好好……喂？這裡是86號，這裡是86號……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒反應？人呢？現在不是換哨的時間吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不是太安靜了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛才為止還有羽獸的叫聲……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "野獸都躲天災去了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天災預計五個小時內就會徹底席捲這裡，他們怎麼敢在這個時候偷懶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "時刻表呢？拿來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說拿來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂、喂，人……人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！這裡是86號小隊！還有人嗎，有人嗎？怎麼回事，有人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1311_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1311_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三個小隊，暫時都安靜了。沒被發現，路徑很安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1311_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "作戰人員按照以下座標移動——醫療人員就按照我留下的記號帶著傷患先撤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1311_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我還有事要確認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1311_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1311_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確實是軍事委員會的頻段。但他們是斥候，不是襲擊據點的無主雇傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1311_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們的任務簡報是“紅草莓”。只是在確認平民的撤退路徑……呵，曼弗雷德甚至欺騙他們說這裡有“王庭要員”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1311_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。看來，只能交給阿斯卡綸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_ex1_snowmount_s"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巴別塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是我的死神嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……是你主導襲擊了巴別塔的據點。你聽從誰的命令？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些人都只是醫生和感染者平民——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "話音未落，劍鋒已至。\n阿斯卡綸感到了一絲違和。\n但她很快調整了狀態，是的，暴力。誘導對話她其實談不上擅長。\n袖刃已然出鞘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你究竟——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁……炸藥嗎……瘋子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你已經束手無策了，還不……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……是我。剛剛結束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他已經被燒成焦炭了，抱歉，沒留下活口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，不太對勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對方一眼認出我是巴別塔的人，僅僅交手了一瞬間就判斷出不是我的對手，選擇了自爆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "太果斷了，要嘛是身經百戰的間諜，要嘛是……\n等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找到了一個隨身行囊，嗯，沒受損，應該是剛才被我切斷的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "裡面有……巴別塔的袖標，還有軍事委員會的勛章。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雇傭兵同時為兩頭效力沒什麼稀奇的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有一張紙片。可能是隨身記錄的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼重要訊息，只看得清一個詞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“戴爾”。家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerId": "avg_4132_ascln_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忘了吧，沒什麼意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutry_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……通訊失效？天災馬上就要降臨了，這種老土貨色確實沒法用了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，但願其他隊伍找到了逃走的辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別發呆了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把不能動的感染者……全部搬到這裡吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也沒什麼希望了啊，又躲不開天災。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然都沒什麼希望了，讓你做你就做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……然後呢？有的都已經重度昏迷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的感染情況比較嚴重，和他們差不多，我來結束他們的痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們死後，源石會擴散，我應該也沒什麼好下場。你躲遠點，拿個弩箭什麼的，替我收個尾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嘟囔）我才不幹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，站住。別靠近那些感染者。尤莉葉會處理的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你把他們像柴火一樣丟在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又不是我願意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們還有救嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒救了，都在等死。不出十分鐘就會全部化成粉末。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們本來有救的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多活一會算不算有救？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們感染太重，離開這裡，也是死在卡茲戴爾哪條破小巷子裡。早知道我還不如繼續待在薩爾貢……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是抑制劑，給他們吧。至少能緩解他們的痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你哪來的抑制劑？不對，你是誰？你什麼時候來這裡的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "報告你的識別碼，否則我就——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓博士過去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都沒事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好像有點眼熟——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殿、殿下！您——您怎麼能——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡是天災下方！我們來不及逃開的！您……很感謝您來……但您……這……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您不該來這裡！我們怎麼承擔得起讓殿下您冒這個風險——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "白色的薩卡茲出現在了戰場上，無聲，突兀。\n人群議論紛紛，這位悄無聲息到來的人物當真是巴別塔的魔王，活著的六英雄之一，卡茲戴爾的孕育者？\n特蕾西婭只是朝錯愕和疑惑的人群點頭致意。\n她跪在了那些感染者身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "垂死的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……殿……下……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我來晚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已不能拯救你們的生命……我做得還遠遠不夠，對不起……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "垂死的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請……不要……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特蕾西婭輕輕握住了他的手。\n其他的感染者，尚有意識的、尚對自己的生命有所留戀的，都同時感受到了那丁點的……溫暖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽著，孩子們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會記住你們每一個人的人生……原諒我，我無法許諾你們更多，但你們的家人、孩子，你們的朋友和戰友……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們終有一日不必在恐慌中活著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "垂死的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們的性命本不該如此渺小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少這一刻，你們應得一個溫暖的夢……一個未來一定能被實現的夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "睡吧，卡茲戴爾的孩子們。在溫暖的家鄉裡安睡吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "睡吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "垂死的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……感……謝……您……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "感染者的身體開始發出源石的色彩。\n很快，細小的礦石就開始侵蝕血肉，將他們承載的生活與欲望，一併變成了璀璨的火光。\n特蕾西婭始終握著他們的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "直到亮閃閃的灰塵升上天空，被風雪打散，無緣成為天上的繁星。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……那麼，您，呃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你願意怎麼稱呼都可以。如果你更喜歡“惡靈”這個說法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我沒那個意思！只是，這好像是我們第一次單獨說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您為我們帶來了很多勝利，我聽從過您的指揮，而且，都說您是一位源石專家……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……“專家”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但其實我是第一次近距離目睹……感染者以這種形式死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤莉葉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……那你真好運。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從沒想過這個畫面是這麼的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多活一會算不算有救？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西婭，我們該出發了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是就算現在出發也來不及，何況還有軍事委員會的陷阱等著我們往裡跳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們回家吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "事後，軍事委員會的行動簡報上寫著：\n“巴別塔的魔王帶領她最信任的部下，撥開了風雪與烈焰。”\n“就像是掀起床簾帶孩子進入夢鄉的母親那樣輕柔。他們沿路撤離，進入了我們的包圍網。”\n“但在場的術師與弩手無一人敢朝那支綿延數百米的隊伍發起襲擊。也無人下令。”\n這份過於舞文弄墨的簡報，與曼弗雷德受王庭要員的“假情報”矇騙一事，一併遭到了委員會的指責，卻並無進一步懲罰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽說了這次的行動，你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希，我有個問題想請教你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對於一個醫生來說，只是讓患者多活一段時間，卻無法挽回注定的死亡，這稱得上拯救嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除非患者主觀上存在其他意願，否則，嘗試拯救生命就是醫生的天職。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們始終為此努力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼問起這個？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是看著阿米婭和我們身邊的人，我就會覺得，你們不該遭受這種折磨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_003_kalts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，凱爾希，原來你們已經在這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情報會議已經結束，戰局因為那場天災陷入了僵局，此刻是我們的喘息之機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們兩個尤其要好好休息！特別是博士，回來之後，你就沒怎麼睡過覺吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特蕾西婭看了凱爾希一眼，凱爾希的眼神中透露出無奈。\n魔王能感覺到，能感覺到愧疚，能感覺到焦躁，目睹那麼多感染者消散在眼前，並不是一件可以讓人輕易接受的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，難道你還覺得……這一切都是你親手造成的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很遺憾。確實是我親手造成的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會逃避責任，也不會因此自怨自艾，只是我需要更多時間……接受現狀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，你太累了。你願意為了這片大地而承擔這些情緒，我很感激。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你現在的痛苦和糾結，想必也象徵你的善意和理想吧。我不會抹去它，但如果你願意，我希望我們能一起分擔……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特蕾西婭想要輕輕握住博士的手，想要感受博士那滿是愧疚和不安的靈魂。\n她想要幫助博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但是，有一絲雜音，不安地迴響在魔王的腦海裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（是博士……拒絕了我？還是……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，特蕾西婭……你不需要承擔那些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必對我使用“文明的存續”，使用它對你而言也是有負擔的，它有更重要的用處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比幫助我們盡心竭力的博士還重要？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵……謝謝，真的謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和Scout都說，我們有喘息的時間，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就讓我親自為你們做一頓晚宴吧，我偷學Misery的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_048",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了迎接日後的挑戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
